      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Ah— 'tis about that queer explosion\r\nI saw the other day.\r\nI was making my rounds about the village when, of\r\na sudden, an explosion sounded, and I saw a mass\r\nof infected spores billow up.",
        "Jp" : "ああ――この前見た、妙な爆発の話だね\r\n村の周辺を見回っていた時に\r\n突然爆発音がして、大量の侵食胞子が\r\n舞い上がるのを見たんだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 542906,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "'Tis no volcanic region, this Morrow Forest. I\r\ncan't imagine aught in these woods that would\r\nexplode... I've a feeling aught ill is afoot.",
        "Jp" : "ここモロー樹林は火山地帯でもないし\r\n森の中に爆発するようなものがあるとは思えない\r\n何かよくないことが起こっているような気がするよ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 552366,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Queer things are afoot, yet I cannot well\r\nleave the village, can I?\r\nSo I've sent word to a warrior acquaintance,\r\nasking them to investigate.",
        "Jp" : "妙なことが起こっているっていうのに\r\n僕が村を離れるわけにはいかないだろう？\r\nだから、知り合いの戦士に連絡を取って\r\n調査を頼んであるんだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 552367,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Since he's such a nice guy, he rushed right over\r\nto the <SPOT 943> to check it out.",
        "Jp" : "気の良い彼だから、すぐに駆けつけて\r\n《<SPOT 943>》へ調査に向かってくれたよ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 552368,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 6,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "As for the new Corruption Demon that troubled\r\nArthfael... he should be thinning\r\ntheir numbers as well.",
        "Jp" : "アルトフェイルが悩んでいた新手の\r\n侵食魔についても、彼が数を減らして\r\nきてくれるはずだよ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 552372,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
