      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 7,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "He should be back by now, I'd think, yet his\r\ndelay weighs on me――",
        "Jp" : "そろそろ戻ってきてもいい頃なんだけど\r\n少し帰りが遅いのは気になるかな――"
