      "GmdIndex" : 18,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "To think Sullivan was captured by the enemy...!\r\n'Twas just a passing thought, mind, but I'm\r\nglad I spoke with you!",
        "Jp" : "サリヴァンが敵に拘束されていたなんて！\r\n軽い気持ちだったけど、君に話しておいて\r\nよかったみたいだ！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 516365,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 19,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Let me thank you for saving him.\r\n—Still... to think Sullivan would say it's\r\nshaping up to be a real mess...",
        "Jp" : "彼を助けてくれて礼を言うよ\r\n――それにしても、サリヴァンが\r\n「大変なことになっていそうだ」なんて\r\n言ったとはね――"
