      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 20,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "He's the sort to laugh off most anything, yet for\r\nhim to turn so grave, I should think we'd best\r\nsteel ourselves for the\r\ninvestigation results as well...",
        "Jp" : "大抵のことは笑い飛ばす性質の彼が\r\nそこまで真剣になるということは\r\n調査結果についても覚悟しておいた方が\r\n良さそうだな――"
      },
